  "description": "Application under Section 73 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) to vary condition 22(p)(further details) and condition 63 (approved drawings) to facilitate amendments to the approved scheme including but not limited to: (i) alterations to ground floor facades on Holborn Viaduct and Farringdon Street to omit digital art screens and incorporate a vitrine to display archaeological artefacts, a historic interpretation plaque and ceramic printed glass artwork; (ii) omission of green wall to north-east corner of Holborn Viaduct facade and replacement with new artwork panel; (iii) alterations to Farringdon Street public realm; and (iv) alterations to the roof plan to omit louvres.",
